        <p>MEDICAL.</p>
        <p>A CARD. TIPIEVEREND JOSEPH HOLMES' improved 11.!:., Mexican Prescription, as discovered in the hot table- lands of Old Mexico, is a guaranteed cure to all those Nth) suffer from the errors and indiscretions of youth, netvous weakness, physical exhaustion. and early decay. To intro- duce it into England, the Mexican Prescription will be st,rit free of charge. upon receipt ef a self addressed stamped envelope. Only address JOSEPIi HotmEs' Remedy Co., Eloomsb,,v Mansions, 'd Bloomsbury-square, London, W.C. Limtion this paper.</p>
